# Suppressions for `trivy` findings we've explicitly reviewed and accepted.
# Format: one finding ID (CVE-..., or a secret rule ID) per line, optionally
# followed by `exp:YYYY-MM-DD` to auto-expire the suppression.
# See https://trivy.dev/latest/docs/configuration/filtering/#trivyignore
#
# Keep this empty unless a finding has been triaged and documented with a
# comment explaining why it's safe to ignore.
